update_rule.pseudocode:
for each person k:
  social_norm = average(adopted of neighbors)
  private_benefit = private_benefit_mean + risk_perception_weight * belief_k
  private_cost = max(0, private_cost_mean - subsidy_map[k])
  enforcement_push = enforcement_map[k]
  utility = social_weight * social_norm + private_benefit - private_cost + enforcement_push
  threshold_k = clamp(Normal(adoption_threshold_mu, adoption_threshold_sigma) * heterogeneity_scale, 0, 1)
  if not adopted_k and utility >= threshold_k:
    adopted_k = True
  elif adopted_k:
    if Bernoulli(habit_formation_rate): threshold_k = max(0, threshold_k - 0.01)
    if utility < threshold_k and Bernoulli(disadoption_rate):
      adopted_k = False
output updated adoption states
